{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cu1","name":"新标点和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89s","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CU1","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"1f0247773be3712e994ac4eccb3b624b101fa6fae60aa587349845096ad56a19","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"TIT","translationId":"cmn_cu1","name":"提多书","commonName":"提多书","title":"提多书","order":56,"numberOfChapters":3,"sha256":"df519a01846b1c55f438a1b8917fff8825afa6339ebe49bdba4ca0ed1d15b991","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/1.json","lastChapterNumber":3,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/3.json","totalNumberOfVerses":46},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["纯正的道理"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["但你所讲的总要合乎那纯正的道理。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["劝老年人要有节制、端庄、自守，在信心、爱心、忍耐上都要纯全无疵。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["又劝老年妇人，举止行动要恭敬，不说谗言，不给酒作奴仆，用善道教训人，"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["好指教少年妇人，爱丈夫，爱儿女，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["谨守，贞洁，料理家务，待人有恩，顺服自己的丈夫，免得 神的道理被毁谤。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["又劝少年人要谨守。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["你自己凡事要显出善行的榜样；在教训上要正直、端庄，"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["言语纯全，无可指责，叫那反对的人，既无处可说我们的不是，便自觉羞愧。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["劝仆人要顺服自己的主人，凡事讨他的喜欢，不可顶撞他，"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["不可私拿东西，要显为忠诚，以致凡事尊荣我们救主— 神的道。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["因为 神救众人的恩典已经显明出来，"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["教训我们除去不敬虔的心和世俗的情欲，在今世自守、公义、敬虔度日，"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["等候所盼望的福，并等候至大的 神和我们",{"noteId":0},"救主耶稣基督的荣耀显现。"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["他为我们舍了自己，要赎我们脱离一切罪恶，又洁净我们，特作自己的子民，热心为善。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["这些事你要讲明，劝戒人，用各等权柄责备人；不可叫人轻看你。"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"-","text":"或译： 神—我们","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cu1/TIT/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}